    s\xF3c h\u1ECD th\u1EADt nghi\xEAm ng\u1EB7t, chu to\xE0n. \\nPh\u1EA3i l\xE0m
    cho h\u1ECD TIN v\xE0o d\u1EF1 \xE1n c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng ta \\nNh\u1EEFng nh\xE2n
    vi\xEAn kh\xF4ng ho\xE0n th\xE0nh nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5, s\u1EBD tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh
